  "description": "A flat membrane in homogeneous tension tests finite-strain equilibrium and Poisson contraction. The reduced plane-stress St Venant-Kirchhoff equations give an exact nonlinear force-stretch relation.",
  "geometry": "Membrane 1 m by 0.4 m, reference thickness 0.01 m; meshes 1x1, 2x2, 4x4 and 8x8.",
  "material": "Synthetic isotropic elastic material: E = 70 MPa, nu = 0.3. Green-Lagrange membrane energy; thickness strain condensed by plane stress.",
  "boundary_conditions": "Every node uz=rx=ry=rz=0; ux=0 at x=0; origin uy=0. Other in-plane displacements free.",
  "loading": "Fixed-direction edge traction for stretches 1.005, 1.02, 1.05 and 1.10; ten continuation steps per independent analysis.",
